  "summary": {
    "zh-CN": "主持人心里藏着一位世界知名人物，孩子用是非题来猜，猜中就升一关，从“名人小萌新”一路挑战到“名人堂守护者”。",
    "en": "The host hides a world-famous person; the child guesses with yes-or-no questions and levels up from Fame Rookie to Hall of Fame Guardian."
  },
